Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.90,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,An air kick turn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:08.47,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:11.06,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:13.69,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I scored a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:18.87,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Are air kick turns that amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:23.25,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,It's one of the most difficult \Nmoves to pull off in Flying Circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.13,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,In order to use a mid-air \Nkick to change directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:29.55,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,you need to have precise membrane control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:32.61,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,"Mem... brain"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:34.88,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,A layer of anti-gravity particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.33,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Even then, you normally wouldn't \Nsee anyone do an air kick turn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:39.56,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,using school Grav-Shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:43.21,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Like a beginner using Li Men Ding Zhou?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:46.71,Main,Shi,0000,0000,0000,,This match is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:49.23,Main,Shi,0000,0000,0000,,The winner is Kurashina Asuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.64,0:00:51.78,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Coach! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.15,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:59.11,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really get all of it, \Nbut Flying Circus is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.05,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Congrats, Kurashina—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.13,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.04,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Kunahama Institute doesn't \Nhave to lose its "In" now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:08.30,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,I graciously admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:12.86,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,That was awfully careless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:13.95,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Satouin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:15.09,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:19.05,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for playing against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:24.16,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you were all over the place, \Nbut you're an amusing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:26.10,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have a rematch sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:27.60,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:31.20,Main,R,0000,0000,0000,,May my wings be covered \Nin the blessings of blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.68,0:01:38.88,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Coach Hinata, thank you so—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:40.78,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Hinata-kun, was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:44.10,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,You have Flying Circus experience, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:46.26,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Your strategies and advice were on point!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:47.54,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Flying Circus experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:49.76,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:53.97,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that Satouin-san moved\N only forward and sideways,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.97,0:01:57.34,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,so I thought that maybe she \Nwas weak at vertical moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:58.75,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:00.74,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,It's good fortune that we met here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.74,0:02:02.48,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:07.04,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,You all are destined to be the saviors \Nof the Kunahama Flying Circus team!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:09.49,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Let us work together from now o—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.49,0:02:11.02,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:45.88,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:48.33,Episode-Title,Title,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1864,1)}Episode Two:\N "Udon...?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:48.33,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai-Misaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:51.09,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,How I miss you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:54.33,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:56.67,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.96,Tobisawa,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Tobisawa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.96,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.97,Main,Old,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Mashiro-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.36,Main,Old,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for always taking care of Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:04.47,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.21,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.35,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I see you're starting another \Nday as Sleeping Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:17.92,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up, Misaki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.11,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Your udon's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:22.29,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Udon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:24.70,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:27.20,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You're a real handful every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.70,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,But I love that about you. too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:31.75,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,So sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.59,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:34.96,Main,Old,0000,0000,0000,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:40.74,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Why do we have to go to school every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.41,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai, you say that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.87,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What's all this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.14,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:56.25,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,So she really can't stay \Nbalanced without that posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.66,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:01.03,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I guess what happened yesterday \Nwas just beginner's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.53,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I heard all about it, Kurashina-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:08.53,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,You actually scored a point against Satouin-san
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.28,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,from Takafuji Academy yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:14.24,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,So the whole school already knows that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:17.07,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,we protected Kunahama Institute's "In"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.00,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,"In"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:24.88,Magazine Top,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Beat {\c&H370BF6&}the Champion, Shindou\NPlayers Fired Up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:24.88,Magazine Bottom,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Satouin Reiko & Ganeko Mayu\NBeauties Soar the Sky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:22.04,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Takafuji Academy is \Na Flying Circus powerhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:24.88,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,and Satouin-san's their vice captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:28.57,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, that's an awesome outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:30.30,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,It's a competition flying suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:33.60,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,And {\i1}you're{\i0} what's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:38.24,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,A total beginner scoring a \Npoint against Satouin-san
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:41.19,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,is basically the upset of the century!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:43.46,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Like that match between the \NUnited States and England!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.43,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,The most shocking result \Nin World Cup history!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:49.38,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Thirty-six years since its pro leagues were \Nsuspended, a USA team full of amateurs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:53.54,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,beat England, which had racked \Nup an incredible 22-4 record!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:56.39,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,How inspiring!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:57.92,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you can keep that magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.99,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:03.60,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Do you play Flying Circus, Aoyagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.11,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I'm just support staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:07.55,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I only joined the team recently, \Nbecause my brother asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:10.06,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Since the seniors all graduated,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:12.14,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,the only members left are the \Ncaptain—my brother—and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:14.36,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Please join, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.25,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.31,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:20.79,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I heard all about your brilliant \Njob as second yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:23.29,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know you played FC, Hinata-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:26.44,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I just played a little when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:29.01,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,We'd love to have experienced players!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.68,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,You should join our FC team, too—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.68,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I won't join.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.92,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Class is about to start, Aoyagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.08,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:45.13,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Eating tsuke udon outdoors is so pawesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:48.97,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,The nukazuke pickles you \Nmade are super-delish, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.65,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:53.47,Registration Form,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Registration Form\N Flying Circus Team\N Class 2-C\N Kurashina Asuka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:53.47,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:56.77,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I filled it out for you, so \Nall you gotta do is submit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.27,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,That goes for you two, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.87,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Talk about covering all the bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.35,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, I'm pretty sure this is forgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.98,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,This actually looks a \Nlot like my handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:07.46,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Join now and get a free drink \Nat your welcome party!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.32,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What is this, a promotional campaign?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.37,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:13.03,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a hotshot scout, Aoyagi-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:15.24,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll join!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.91,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no good at all, but I look \Nforward to working with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:23.21,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}All right! Thank you, Kurashina-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.92,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Did the free drink seal the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.21,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:25.29,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Join us, Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.63,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,You used to play, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:30.21,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... I don't meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:34.39,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way she can \Ncome to morning practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:37.43,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Also, she does things her own way,\N so she can't handle the sports lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.79,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.60,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it, Tobisawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:45.73,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:52.24,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,So, to remain healthy \Nthroughout one's life... {\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:52.24,Italics,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:57.67,Italics,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,And here I thought I had \Nno desire to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.95,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:03.43,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not hiding it very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:07.48,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm s-so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:08.29,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,...rry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:19.60,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the Flying Circus team!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.93,Flying Circus,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Flying Circus Fan Club Team
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.93,Enter,Sign,0130,0001,0088,,Enter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.93,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, good, you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:23.95,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:24.69,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:26.94,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,This is our club room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:29.69,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.07,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry it's so cramped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:36.66,Muscles are Life,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,1187)}Muscles are Life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:35.65,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, Bro, I told you \Nto clean this place up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:37.51,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:38.83,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.96,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, this is the club room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.56,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tobisawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.82,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,And Arisaka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:48.98,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What, am I not allowed to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:51.30,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Just so you know, wherever \NMisaki-senpai goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:53.22,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.89,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,We got three members at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.10,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy for you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:02.43,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Practice starts tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.77,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.81,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Good work on day duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:09.82,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think, Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:15.85,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina, Tobisawa, and that first-year\N Arisaka submitted registration forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.25,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,The Kunahama FC team, which \Nhad been reduced to a fan club,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.69,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,just got three new members at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.75,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:25.94,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:28.63,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.52,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:32.89,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.71,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have to be Kurashina-san's \Ninstructor anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:38.31,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, she's joining the FC team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.47,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:44.47,Flashback,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in your care, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:49.99,Flashback,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm flying! I'm actually flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:37.23,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Coach Hinata?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:38.99,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:44.41,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina-san, I'm not your coach anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:46.66,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:50.22,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I told Kagami-sensei I wasn't needed anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.92,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,since you joined the FC team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.26,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.57,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.01,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Let's start practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.62,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Put your spirit into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.52,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,First off, let's practice \Nflying from buoy to buoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:08.48,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:09.96,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:13.40,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I'll get off my tail for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.24,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,A motivated Misaki-senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:20.38,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Going home, Masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:23.16,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:25.52,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you stay and watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:26.91,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:37.60,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:45.37,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,These newcomers have rather grim prospects.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:47.84,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,They need to start with the very basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:50.98,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Run, train their core muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.15,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,and improve their reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.65,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you give them that advice, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.28,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:04.36,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.11,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:09.06,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:12.91,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,My HP's been reduced to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:14.72,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,You lack spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:17.06,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,We won't be ready for the \Nsummer tournament this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.88,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Well now. Today's their first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.68,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,And we have to get them competition \NGrav-Shoes and flying suits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:25.29,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:28.05,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,It's not fair that you're the only \None with a full set of equipment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.48,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.06,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Saturday, so how \N'bout we all go shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:34.69,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.88,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't used my Grav-Shoes in ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.57,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll have to get them tuned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:39.57,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,What about you, Kurashina-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.68,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:44.67,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,And let's all take part \Nin the summer tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:46.13,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:48.47,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Then we need to show more spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.36,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.96,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:56.87,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:57.50,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.71,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.06,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:01.44,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Come this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.63,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:07.05,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, the ceiling's so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:10.56,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,It's so people can take test flights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.81,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Shirase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.34,Main,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.02,Main,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Madoka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.73,Main,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Not with your brother today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:22.58,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,I've brought the new members of the \NKunahama FC team with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:25.30,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:31.79,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is that a guardian angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:34.27,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's my little sister, Minamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.68,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Let's head to the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:37.95,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pick out Grav-Shoes that suit you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:39.42,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:44.96,Main,Min,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Which type of Grav-Shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:46.05,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,The mannequin talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:48.18,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,"Type"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:54.18,Main,Min,0000,0000,0000,,There are three types of Grav-Shoes: for \Nspeeders, fighters, and all-rounders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.44,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,There are various styles of play that \Neach call for different shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:02.69,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,The speeder type, which specializes in \Nscoring points by touching the buoys faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:06.95,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,The fighter type, which focuses in scoring \Npoints by touching the opponent's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.82,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,And the all-rounder type, \Nwhich is good at both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:14.20,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,These styles of play require Grav-Shoes \Nthat emit membranes in different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:15.73,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, membranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:17.95,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Layers of anti-gravity particles, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.08,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:30.51,Anti-Gravity,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Anti-Gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:21.61,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Grav-Shoes help you float \Nusing anti-gravity particles,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.49,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,and move using the Earth's gravitational field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:25.68,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,You know that much, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.88,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,And they propel you forward and back
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.51,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,by adjusting the thickness of the membranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:34.50,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Speeder-type Grav-Shoes are calibrated \Nto obtain the highest top speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:38.92,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,while fighter-types have lower \Ntop speeds but improve agility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:41.21,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You make things so easy \Nto understand, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:43.40,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't know which to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.23,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a complete beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:49.61,Main,Min,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then I recommend you start \Nwith the all-rounder type.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:52.77,Main,Min,0000,0000,0000,,The shoes come with balancing tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.88,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,which allow for fine-tuning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:57.00,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:00.00,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,What type are you, Misaki-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.51,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? I'm a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.54,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll go with fighter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:08.13,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:10.40,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:14.30,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided to appeal to \NMisaki-senpai using cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.24,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Those are for speeders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:19.27,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,She's got her priorities all mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:23.07,Main,Min,0000,0000,0000,,W-We'll calibrate it for fighter use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:24.92,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.65,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,No go, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:31.15,Main,H,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:35.81,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like the flying suits \Nwill take about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.12,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:41.79,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,By then, we'll have to be \Ngood enough to play in matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:42.75,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.08,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm still no good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:46.92,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:50.33,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be the re-release \Nversion of "Downhill,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:52.80,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,the legendary electro-mechanical \Narcade game?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:55.46,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'll head home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:56.09,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:58.09,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:59.55,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play!{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:01.31,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't wanna. Sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.99,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Those two sure are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:03.99,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai! {\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:05.06,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,They sure are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.21,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't wanna. Sounds like a pain.{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:07.87,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be leaving, too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.87,0:16:09.36,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,See you Monday at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.16,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Join us, Kurashina-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:15.24,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm not much of a gamer, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.23,Italics,M,0000,0000,0000,,Relax your waist, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:44.35,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I finally have competition Grav-Shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:46.23,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Put your foot down, Kurashina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:48.24,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:50.50,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's practice with spirit—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.01,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Captain, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:53.49,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:55.96,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I want to have a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:59.28,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, wow. Throwing yourself \Nto the wolves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:00.45,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.58,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,No, with Kurashina-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:04.83,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:07.22,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:10.50,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Show us your air kick turn again, Kurashina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:11.88,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.76,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's zipzap together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:18.01,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,V-Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:25.12,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a match?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.04,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect timing, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.73,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,We need you as second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:29.96,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:31.44,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:35.77,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there someone more suited than I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:39.96,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.37,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:43.16,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I won't do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:44.81,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Hinata-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.54,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in your care again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.29,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:49.54,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Tobisawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:50.77,Italics,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,You ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:51.88,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:53.61,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:56.30,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I have to either touch the \Nfour buoys in sequence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.80,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,or touch your back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:17:59.59,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:03.06,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,But I won't let you touch \Nanything that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:04.17,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:05.31,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.20,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.54,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:17.07,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,She said she was a fighter, but she's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.38,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Point scored by Misaki! 1-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.95,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:27.90,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:28.87,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Lean further forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.31,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:35.27,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,2-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.92,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, she'll get\Nthe third point, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:41.35,Italics,M,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about the third point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.64,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Take a shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:44.55,Italics,M,0000,0000,0000,,Head right for the fourth line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:46.52,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,What's a shortcut, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:51.10,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Abandoning a buoy and getting to \Nthe next line before your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.74,0:18:58.70,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Kurashina-san, shall we \Ngive that move another go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.58,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Misaki! 3-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.80,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.10,Italics,M,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:11.77,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.88,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,Is the air kick turn coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:25.85,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Open your legs wide to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.59,0:19:30.02,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:34.36,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Misaki! 4-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:37.03,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,That was a close shave. Nice, Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:38.90,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,She still scored a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:41.40,Main,Sh,0000,0000,0000,,So it really was just beginner's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:44.62,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:47.66,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Point to Misaki! 5-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:52.71,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.83,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,6-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:59.51,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,It's as though Kurashina-senpai \Nhas a bull's-eye on her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:04.05,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:06.30,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,7-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:09.58,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,8—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.43,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,9-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:13.19,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Do whatever you can to lose her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:14.58,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Change this momentum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:17.77,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'll at least score one point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.51,0:20:27.84,Italics,A,0000,0000,0000,,At least one point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.62,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,This match is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.03,0:20:36.54,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,Tobisawa Misaki wins 9-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:44.93,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:49.41,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't do the air kick turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.05,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,and I couldn't score a single point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:54.44,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.68,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Misaki's got FC experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:59.86,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,and you only just started—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:20:59.86,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to get good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.73,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to get better!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:05.56,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Please be my coach again, Hinata-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.12,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:11.08,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you gonna turn down such a cutie pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.50,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:13.90,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:16.46,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,How about at least until \Nthe summer tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.75,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no good at all, but please teach me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.52,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:27.18,Main,M,0000,0000,0000,,As long as it's only till \Nthe summer tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.89,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:33.64,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,All's well that ends well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:35.69,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:41.02,Italics,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure what this feeling \Nis, but it's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:44.08,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I fell for you all over again, Misaki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:46.48,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,You were like a cougar after its prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.83,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,A cougar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:50.26,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,We'll have to celebrate your victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:52.29,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,I'll treat you to an extra-large udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.68,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Udon...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:56.14,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Extra large!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:56.62,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.37,0:22:00.93,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? This is Kagami, from Kunahama High.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:21:59.97,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hurry up and go! {\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:01.35,Main,Mas,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, Senpai!{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:02.96,Main,Mad,0000,0000,0000,,You're leaving already?{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:03.97,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. We've got more members now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:04.80,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:07.63,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,so if possible, we'd like the help \Nof Takafuji, the powerhouse school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.41,0:22:10.00,Main,Aoi,0000,0000,0000,,If you would be so kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.10,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,we'd love to hold a joint \Ntraining camp with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:15.10,To be Continued,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,To Be Continued
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.19,0:23:46.61,Preview,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1028,1)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:49.74,Main,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, this is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:50.70,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course the practice would be hardcore.{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:52.11,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:55.07,Episode-Title - End,Title,0000,0000,0000,,Episode Three:\N "I Just Got a Little Fired Up"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:54.56,Main,Mi,0000,0000,0000,,I just got a little fired up.
